message: "If you reference this work, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "π = π — Pi fungibility: a native Pi payment carries no observable per-unit mining origin"
abstract: >-
  A source-verified, dependency-free, read-only analysis with runnable on-chain checks showing that
  Pi Network's native asset (π) is fungible. A native Pi payment carries no observable per-unit mining
  origin on the Pi Mainnet ledger: π mined in the Pi app, π withdrawn from an exchange (OKX / Bitget),
  and π sent from inside a Pi Browser app are the same native asset. The analysis separates three claims:
  (A) fungibility — proven; (B) a specific deposit is native on-chain — verifiable; (C) reserve backing —
  not claimed.
type: software
